-- title:
--   A three-torsion lift sends one to its generator
-- statement:
--   Let $G$ be an abelian group. For $e\in G$ with $3e=0$, let $L:\mathbb Z/3\mathbb Z\to G$ be the additive map induced by $n\mapsto ne$. Then
--
--   $$L(1)=e.$$
--
--   The result includes $e=0$ and records the normalization of the quotient lift.
